Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Moo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Moo allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.65,0:00:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Americanist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.87,0:00:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Was a redevelopment up in this video.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,so he wanted to prove another famous\Nvideo of your victory qua supe устрой,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.69,0:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch Souls, come and\Nlisten to the scenes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.61,0:00:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, this is up to you, think?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.99,0:01:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the man?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Weevil, I'm only two\Nlocator cards away from the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.65,0:01:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That was some seriously impressive\Ndueling back there, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.93,0:01:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You sent that cheater running out of\NBattle City like a roach from a spray can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.61,0:01:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.69,0:01:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I was the star of\Nthe show today, wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The crowd dug me, I crushed Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.89,0:01:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What a duel, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.21,0:01:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I got that termite's\Nrarest card, the Insect Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.93,0:01:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And you totally deserve\Nit, Joey. Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.39,0:01:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, you've outsmarted\Ntwo top duelists,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and both of them turned\Nout to be major cheaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.23,0:01:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why do I attract these freaks?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.71,0:01:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good practice, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.65,0:01:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dueling Esperoba and Weevil\Nprepared you for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.75,0:01:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on your way to becoming\Nan experienced duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.89,0:01:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:01:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat your heart out, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.91,0:01:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope Yugi's safe, wherever he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.89,0:01:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get going, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.49,0:02:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We still got to find Yugi, and\NJoey needs another challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.35,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, do my friends rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.05,0:02:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I never could have gotten\Nthis far without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.07,0:02:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wish Yugi could have seen me\Nsquash Weevil right out of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.81,0:02:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think Yugi is, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.01,0:02:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't be too far. We'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.77,0:02:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow them, my hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need them all soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.95,0:02:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come for my arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything seems to be in place, but\Nbefore I step foot in Battle City,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.57,0:02:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have one more task to complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.55,0:02:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, if all goes as planned, the\Npower of the Pharaoh will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.17,0:02:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Merrick, is it time\Nthe Quiet One waits? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall control his mind and\Neliminate Yugi once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.39,0:02:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, I'll take that puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.87,0:02:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This dude hasn't moved\Nin like three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.77,0:03:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Duh, he's a mime genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.39,0:03:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He stands there all quiet and\Nwe're supposed to be impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.15,0:03:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.31,0:03:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he pretending to be\Na statue or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.93,0:03:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth to mime, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.39,0:03:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone home in that bald head of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.73,0:03:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.83,0:03:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, are you gonna move or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.83,0:03:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Awaken my mind, slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it something that I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.37,0:03:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now locate Yugi Motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.09,0:03:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was like pretty weird
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.41,0:03:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use one of my two Egyptian\NGod Cards to devastate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.07,0:03:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick keeps talking about wanting the\Npower of the pharaoh But you are the pharaoh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really had all\Nthis power inside you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.57,0:03:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that\Nwe would know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.69,0:03:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you must if you save\Nthe world But what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all still unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.71,0:03:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we know that Merrick's family's\Nbeen protecting your tomb for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and for some reason he\Ngot this crazy idea that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.35,0:04:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,he deserved to be the\Npharaoh instead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.09,0:04:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna do everything\NI can to help make
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.85,0:04:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,sure that Merrick\Ndoesn't get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he can't defeat us in a duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,he can't take the Millennium\NPuzzle or your hidden powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Destiny brought this puzzle to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.11,0:04:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And even though I didn't know\Nit when I first put it together,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.91,0:04:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I was meant to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.43,0:04:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you and I are bonded forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And no matter what, I'm going\Nto help you save the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,just like you did in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have done it alone 5,000 years\Nago, but now you've got me by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.39,0:04:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And not only that, but we've\Nalso got our friends behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And with this kind of\Nsupport, you'll never lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.25,0:04:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friendship means a great deal to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.01,0:04:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, we're going to find out about\Nyour past and put a stop to Merrick's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.13,0:04:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope that I'm strong\Nenough to hold my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already proven your strength, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.51,0:04:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your courage and determination\Nare as great as I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.31,0:05:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I've said it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.73,0:05:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the heart of a pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense a darkness approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.69,0:05:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.17,0:05:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.15,0:05:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.77,0:05:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to duel and lose\Nyour puzzle. Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and soon you and the entire\Nworld will be calling me Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet my mind, slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Strings, the quiet one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to the power of my\NMillennium Rod, he shall defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.27,0:05:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.25,0:05:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet soon enough, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, why should I waste my time when\NI can duel you through my mind puppets?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Battling with the power\Nof my Millennium Rod is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.69,0:06:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,no different than you\Nusing your puzzle to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.65,0:06:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.61,0:06:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You force your servants\Nto do your dirty work by
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.57,0:06:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,taking control of their\Nminds against their will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.13,0:06:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I duel with respect and honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will do what is necessary\Nto claim that puzzle. To do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.07,0:06:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have to defeat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick And break the heart of the cards\NAnd I can assure you that won't happen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.73,0:06:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just see how you fare against an
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Egyptian god card You\Ncall yourself a pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know how to use\Nyour power So destiny has chosen me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.63,0:06:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,to take the power of the pharaoh\Naway from you And then destroy you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.77,0:06:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That ancient power is not\Nyours to take, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.21,0:06:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No way is he getting\Nhis hands on your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.67,0:06:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I just did. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.24,0:06:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.67,0:06:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The wheels of fate are in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Merrick faces Yami.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.25,0:07:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And although my brother Merrick follows\Nthe path of evil, he can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.61,0:07:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There is good inside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But in order for his good side to shine,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.01,0:07:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,my brother must fail in his quest\Nto obtain the power of the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.31,0:07:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So my ring has led me to the museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It senses another Millennium item inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.05,0:07:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You must continue to show me\Nthe way to this item, my ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.61,0:07:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon all seven will belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.79,0:07:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Eva.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.83,0:07:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The mystical Millennium\Nenergies are growing stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.97,0:07:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be getting closer to the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.19,0:07:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the Millennium\NItem I seek is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.45,0:07:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Force is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.89,0:08:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh's tablets are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been quite a long time since I've\Nlaid my eyes on these stone carvings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.87,0:08:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But I am sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.53,0:08:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,once I obtain the seven millennium items,\NI can unlock the shadow magic it depicts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.07,0:08:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This spirit has some knowledge of the\Nancient scriptures, but doesn't know all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,For my brother seeks a\Npower far more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.77,0:08:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd use your millennium rod on\Nyour own flesh and blood, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you continue to stand in my way,\Nsister, then, yes, you leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.35,0:08:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh's power isn't yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.19,0:08:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.17,0:08:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Only my brother's failure can save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He must not succeed or the\Nentire world will be in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The true Pharaoh is the\Nonly one who can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I am victorious,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.89,0:09:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Puzzle will be around\Nmy neck at last. Then I can focus on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.63,0:09:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,stripping Kaiba of the third Egyptian\NGod card Once I possess all three,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll combine their strength And in\Naccordance with the ancient scriptures,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drain the power of the Pharaoh\Nhimself. Nothing can stop me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle City and the world\Nwill tremble at my feet
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plan will never work,\NMerrick I'm afraid it already has.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.01,0:09:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I've drawn you into a duel\Nyou can't possibly win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over for you, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.97,0:09:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.59,0:09:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No more talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.57,0:09:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to be destroyed by the\Nforce of my Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.71,0:09:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.37,0:09:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.67,0:10:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your mind slave will\Nnever win my puzzle, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.45,0:10:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.91,0:10:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I set one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.65,0:10:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And play this monster in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.61,0:10:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Humanoid Slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning of\Nthe end for you, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.47,0:10:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So make your move and\Nprepare to lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.65,0:10:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You will fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.07,0:10:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Since he played a really weak monster,\NI bet he wants me to attack it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.97,0:10:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll use his face down\Ncard to destroy my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.51,0:10:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's no way I'm going\Nto let him get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.23,0:10:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I also set one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll summon a\Nmonster known as Gazelle,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Mythical\NBeasts, in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.55,0:10:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A stronger beast than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.49,0:10:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, your monster is almost\Ntwice as strong as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.85,0:10:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't be so confident that\Nyour gazelle will prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:11:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes more than strength to win a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.01,0:11:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.85,0:11:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you won't be surprised when my\Nhumanoid slime annihilates your monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.01,0:11:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try that, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.21,0:11:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.41,0:11:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Worm Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.21,0:11:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch what happens when\NI activate my magic card!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for polymerization!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.13,0:11:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use it to fuse humanoid slime and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.97,0:11:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wormdrake together into\Na diabolical new monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.35,0:11:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold my new weapon, Humanoid Worm Drake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.21,0:11:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Its 2200 attack points are more\Nthan enough to destroy your gazelle,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.65,0:11:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as a portion of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.03,0:11:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,When you fuse two monsters together, you\Nmust wait one turn before you can attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've left yourself\Nwide open, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's of no concern to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.87,0:11:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Rules are meant to be manipulated,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:12:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and my face-down card will\Ntake care of that task for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.31,0:12:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've simply outsmarted you, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.85,0:12:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal face-down card, the\Nquick attack magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.89,0:12:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can attack now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Very perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.93,0:12:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick attack allows my monster to\Nattack in the same turn it was formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you've underestimated\Nme as a duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.19,0:12:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And for that, you must pay a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So watch as I destroy your\Nmonster and move one step
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.13,0:12:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,closer to relieving you of\Nyour Millennium Puzzle forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.59,0:12:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're no\Nmatch for me, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.65,0:12:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch as my humanoid worm attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his gazelle, my beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.65,0:12:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate defusion, turning your\None monster into two again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you knew my plan at the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.33,0:12:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, as soon as you played a monster as\Nweak as humanoid slime in attack mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew then and there that you were\Nluring me to attack it, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.63,0:13:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And I thought you fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.75,0:13:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I wanted you to think,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.85,0:13:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but it was really I who\Nwas luring you to use
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.49,0:13:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,your hidden magic card so\Nthat I could reverse it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.29,0:13:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping for a far more\Nchallenging duel from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.23,0:13:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but you've only disappointed me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.35,0:13:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's far from\Nover. You'll never win my
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.79,0:13:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium Puzzle if you\Ncontinue dueling like that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.17,0:13:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you're as smart\Nas they say you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.67,0:13:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but that last turn was only a test I will\Nnot be denied my victory or your puzzle
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.87,0:13:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You will if you keep making amateur moves
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.47,0:13:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall witness my\Ntrue skills in due time
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.77,0:13:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I defeat you, I'll\Nbecome Pharaoh and banish you to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the shadow realm the relentless\Npower of my egyptian god card
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,will deliver me your puzzle\Nand assure your destruction
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,prepare to face a force the likes\Nof which you have never seen
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.83,0:14:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,your puzzle and your power will\Nsoon be mine only if you win
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,buster blader's too powerful\Nto waste on his weak monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.57,0:14:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure it'll come in handy when\NMerrick plays something more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll hold it till the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.39,0:14:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll dispose of your weak monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.41,0:14:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Beta the Magnet\NWarrior in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his Wormdrake now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.65,0:14:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, my Gazelle will attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.29,0:14:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his humanoid slime\Nwith your Claw of Destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.45,0:14:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The difference in their attack strengths\Nmeans you lose 1,000 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Merrick, you have no\Nmonsters left to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm just testing out your\Nstrengths and weaknesses so that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.57,0:14:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can ultimately destroy you and\Ntake away all that you possess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:15:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for round two, and this\Nduel is about to get interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.99,0:15:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.77,0:15:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The card I now hold is like\Nnothing you've ever seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.19,0:15:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a creature that\Nsimply cannot be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.01,0:15:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shapeless being made completely\Nof plasma with no solid mass,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.33,0:15:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,making it utterly indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.47,0:15:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And the perfect defense\Nagainst enemy attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.17,0:15:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So prepare to experience\NRevival Jab in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.73,0:15:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.43,0:15:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You will fail, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.81,0:15:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks weak to me, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.85,0:15:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks weak, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.27,0:15:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.17,0:15:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my gem, Breeding Machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.61,0:15:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And it begins the countdown\Nto your destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.27,0:15:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it as a monster-creating machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.77,0:15:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,breathing life into a new\Nplasma creature every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.97,0:16:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And this machine will\Ncontinue to provide me with
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.91,0:16:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,more and more plasma\Nbeasts called Slime Tokens!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.57,0:16:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plan's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.77,0:16:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to produce\Nplasma monsters until you have
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.77,0:16:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,enough to sacrifice and\Nsummon your Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.49,0:16:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad you can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.27,0:16:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Once my breeding machine\Ncreates three slime tokens,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.71,0:16:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to summon the monster that\Nwill bring about your ultimate destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,my Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And then your Millennium Puzzle\Nwill belong to me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.29,0:16:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Merrick, but as long as I\Nbelieve in the heart of the cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.49,0:16:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plan will never work,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.25,0:16:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,so prepare to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My Buster Blader!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's the perfect time to summon him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to wipe out\NMerrick's life points before
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,his breeding machine\Ncreates three more monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll sacrifice my two monsters\Non the field to summon this creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.99,0:16:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My all-powerful Buster Blader!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.99,0:17:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My expert swordsman has\Nthe power to wipe out your
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,revival gem and more than\Nhalf of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.77,0:17:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monster's attack strength\Nis quite impressive, Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.65,0:17:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's still useless\Nagainst my revival gem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.97,0:17:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my sword-wielding monster,\Ndestroy his revival gem!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.69,0:17:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monster's been splattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.23,0:17:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,As it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.41,0:17:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's reforming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.55,0:17:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you my Revival Gem\Nemployed the perfect defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.05,0:17:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the most powerful sword\Ncannot destroy my plasma monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.11,0:17:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It will always reform itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.61,0:17:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can't attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.15,0:17:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.41,0:17:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It just won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.41,0:17:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So Revival Jam will\Nprotect my life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.43,0:18:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,while my breeding machine continues to\Ncreate monsters for my ultimate sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.63,0:18:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I need to find another way\Nto wipe out his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.23,0:18:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.37,0:18:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dueling days are almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon my breeding machine will have\Ncreated enough monsters to sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.89,0:18:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then comes your worst nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.23,0:18:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My Egyptian God card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.83,0:18:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate my jam breeding machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.97,0:18:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There's slime token number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll also set one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.59,0:18:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Only two turns left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'll meet your doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.55,0:18:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, that puzzle's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.81,0:18:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not be able to stop\Nyour breeding machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.23,0:18:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but your plan has one\Ntragic flaw, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The rules state you\Nneed to sacrifice three
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,slime tokens to summon\Nyour one Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happens if I\Ndestroy them first? You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.23,0:18:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,your slime tokens are defenseless against
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.15,0:18:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the superior attack power\Nof my Buster Blader.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.79,0:19:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take them out with no resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.75,0:19:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And more importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,each time Buster Blader destroys\None of your slime tokens,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.59,0:19:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll lose over 2,000 life\Npoints because they're so feeble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.47,0:19:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So according to my calculations,\Nin two turns you'll be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.89,0:19:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Buster Blader,\Nattack his slime token!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.31,0:19:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Or don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.43,0:19:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal Facedown card, the\NContinuous Trap card, Jam Defender!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.93,0:19:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.55,0:19:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Revival Jam shielded\Nyour monster! Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.85,0:19:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And as long as Revival\NJam stays in defense mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.79,0:19:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,the Jam Defender card forces it\Nto absorb all of your attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.15,0:19:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means every one of\Nyour attacks will be blocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd attack my\Nslime tokens in a desperate
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.91,0:19:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,attempt to stop me from\Nsummoning my Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.35,0:20:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So I protected them with\Nan indestructible force.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.45,0:20:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, another beast to sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet slime token number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.03,0:20:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.15,0:20:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's only\None turn left, pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.21,0:20:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll summon my Egyptian\NGod card to destroy you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but just to be safe, I think I'll play\Nthis magic card, Nightmare Steel Cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.57,0:20:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,to make sure you can't attack\Nme for the next two turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.73,0:20:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that you'll be around that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.99,0:20:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all you can do is watch\Nwhile I summon the most
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.15,0:20:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,powerful force you've ever\Nseen to annihilate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.19,0:20:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, the Millennium Puzzle and the\NPharaoh's power will be mine forever!
